@startuml F4.2e-erro-403
title F4.2e — 403 sem internship.review / escopo
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "COEController" as Ctrl
participant "AssignInternshipUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

== Cenário A — sem authority ==
Prof -> WebApp: /comissoes/coe
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /comissoes/coe
note right of Jwt
  internship.review ausente
end note
Jwt --> WebApp: 403

== Cenário B — escopo ==
Prof -> WebApp: Atribuir fora do COE
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /comissoes/coe/atribuicoes
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT estágio
Postgres --> UC: fora de escopo
UC --> WebApp: 403

@enduml
